  "body": "Enjoy the privacy and peace of top-floor living in this light-filled two-bedroom apartment, with elevated coastal views, a sunny private balcony and secure parking.\r\n\r\nWith lift access, secure entry, dedicated parking and an easy-care layout, this is a smart option for buyers looking for a low-maintenance home without giving up lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWhy you'll love it:\r\n\r\n• Elevated coastal views from your private balcony\r\n• Top-floor position with no neighbours above\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living\r\n• Lift access and secure building entry\r\n• Dedicated secure car park\r\n• 2 bedrooms and 1 bathroom.\r\n\r\nA great opportunity for first-home buyers, downsizers, investors or anyone looking for an easy-care coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nContact Olga Grinkevich to arrange a private viewing or come along to the next open home.",
